# Play test of Glowfall Isle (CIPlay glowfall_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: up the furrow into the crater,
# the scorched page and the crate from the pit, the castaway's lean-to in the jungle, the cave on the south shore and its
# bear, the barrel by the sunken plate, the buried tin. Points as in its recipe.
island Glowfall Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Screecher 1
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
where CaravanRocket
kill Screecher
walk 48 -18 to 42 -10 to 36 -2 to 30 6 h=2.5
expect stand 28 8 h=2.5
read Scorched page
open Crate from the pit
walk -37.75 15 to -37.75 18 to -37.75 21 h=4.1
read The castaway's book
open Castaway's chest
kill Warthog
kill Bear
walk -19 -72 to -19 -66 to -19 -60 to -19 -57 h=2.1 below=3
expect stand -19 -57 h=2 below=3
open Bear's hoard
open Barrel by the plate
expect hidden vinechest
dig
expect animals Bear 0
expect animals Warthog 0
